    "q": "What is the difference between Ethiopian kale and sukuma wiki?",
    "a": "Both are in the Brassica family but different species. Ethiopian kale (Brassica carinata) has darker, more robust leaves with a more intense, nutty flavour. Sukuma wiki (Brassica oleracea) is milder and more widely grown in Kenya."
