   "history": "Maharage ya Nazi is one of the most distinctive dishes of the Tanzanian coast — the combination of slow-cooked beans with thick coconut milk produces a richness and depth that no other bean preparation can match. It is the dish that makes visitors to Zanzibar understand why coconut milk is used in everything on the coast — because it makes everything better. Served at every celebration, every family meal, and every mama lishe on the coast."
